# GitHub renders relative image paths in a README against the repository root,
# but Sphinx resolves them relative to docs/ because index.rst does
# `include ../README.rst`. The same figure directive cannot satisfy both, so
# the paths in README.rst are written the way Sphinx needs and the rule below
# tells GitHub where to actually find those files.
#
# Pattern matches the referenced path, value is the prefix to prepend.
docs/screenshots/*.png  docs/screenshots/